     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nDear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nhere&#39;s a postdoc position which will be interesting for many on this list.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nBest regards  --- Marc</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font style=\"font-size:11pt\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> Tord Snäll &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tord....@slu.se</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Monday, March 6, 2023 10:55<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Tord Snäll &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tord....@slu.se</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> postdoc position</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div lang=\"SV\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\">Dear all,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\">I would much appreciate help to spread this add for a postdoc position in my group.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\">Sorry for cross-posting, thanks very much for your help.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\">Best regards,<br>\r\nTord</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Postdoc: Modelling future biodiversity, ecosystem services and climate</span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\">Depending on your expertise, you will develop models for the spatial distribution or dynamics of forest species, or make projections and optimizations using available models for biodiversity and ecosystem services assuming scenarios for the\r\n future. We answer ecological and conservation questions based om modelling distribution patterns or (meta)population dynamics of birds, beetles, plants, bryophytes, lichens and fungi. We further study how scenarios of socio-economic policy or development,\r\n climate change or forest management on different spatial scales (global, EU, landscape) may affect the future biodiversity, ecosystem services and climate. We also  investigate conflicts and synergies between these responses using a simulation &amp; optimization\r\n framework. The work is funded by Formas and the ForestValue project <a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/project/SustMultBiomass-Sustainable-and-multifunctional-use-of-forest-biomass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.researchgate.net/project/SustMultBiomass-Sustainable-and-multifunctional-use-of-forest-biomass&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449035754000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JRMARfuSjlyiKE2AEZPro\">\r\nSustMultBiomass</a>.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\">--<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Tord Snäll<br>\r\nProfessor</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red;background:white\" lang=\"EN-GB\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Sveriges lantbruksuniversitet<br>\r\nSwedish University of Agricultural Sciences</span></b><span lang=\"EN-GB\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">SLU ArtDatabanken/SLU Swedish Species Information Centre</span><span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Box 7007, SE-750 07 Uppsala</span><span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Besöksadress: Almas allé 8E\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Telefon: <a href=\"tel:+46%2018%2067%2026%2012\" value=\"+4618672612\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+46(0)18-67 26 12</a>, Mobil: <a href=\"tel:+46%2076%20766%2026%2012\" value=\"+46767662612\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+46(0)76-766 26 12</a></span><span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.slu.se/artdatabanken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.slu.se/artdatabanken&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449035754000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dfHaunumUuhQWKLyh5cl-\"><span style=\"color:blue\">www.slu.se/artdatabanken</span></a></span><span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.slu.se/artdatabanken/tordsnall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.slu.se/artdatabanken/tordsnall&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449035754000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2aPBmHRlzjVEZI3Lvmfe4K\"><span style=\"color:blue\">www.slu.se/artdatabanken/tordsnall</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red;background:white\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>---<br>\r\nNär du skickar e-post till SLU så innebär detta att SLU behandlar dina personuppgifter. För att läsa mer om hur detta